{"4312090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Marzu", "steam_appid": 4312090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two brothers. One vanished into the ruins first. Now you play the one left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Marzu</i> begins as your brother's story an explorer drawn into ancient ruins that were never meant to be found. When he disappears without a trace, you take his place, following the same corridors, the same warnings, and the same whispers that swallowed him whole. You have no weapons and no way to fight back. Your only chance is to stay hidden, stay quiet, and know when to run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/984873e5381e7b057504a59573a070e1.poster.avif?t=1786559928\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/984873e5381e7b057504a59573a070e1.webm?t=1786559928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/984873e5381e7b057504a59573a070e1.mp4?t=1786559928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Marzu</i> is a first-person survival horror game told through two perspectives. You begin as the first brother, exploring the ruins and encountering the first signs that something is wrong. When he becomes trapped, you take control of the second brother, whose journey is about uncovering the truth — not just surviving it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across your journey you'll move through vast ancient halls, cramped tunnels, and an overgrown forest buried within the ruins, each hiding its own dangers and its own guardian. There is no combat, no weapons, and no way to fight what hunts you. Survival depends entirely on stealth — staying out of sight, controlling your noise, and choosing the right moment to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/61c34b07efc76a1ec25b3202c011dde5.poster.avif?t=1786559928\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/61c34b07efc76a1ec25b3202c011dde5.webm?t=1786559928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/61c34b07efc76a1ec25b3202c011dde5.mp4?t=1786559928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/f509a6750742b2a87d62101ef52c12e6.poster.avif?t=1786559928\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/f509a6750742b2a87d62101ef52c12e6.webm?t=1786559928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/f509a6750742b2a87d62101ef52c12e6.mp4?t=1786559928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic lighting, detailed ancient architecture, and immersive 3D sound design bring each biome of <i>Marzu</i> to life   from the echoing stone of the great halls to the choking dark of the tunnels and the unnatural quiet of the forest. As you go deeper, even the world around you stop making sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/bd0c3bfefeb60144790f4ec50cf80813.poster.avif?t=1786559928\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/bd0c3bfefeb60144790f4ec50cf80813.webm?t=1786559928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/bd0c3bfefeb60144790f4ec50cf80813.mp4?t=1786559928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play two brothers across one story — the one who was lost, and the one who follows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore distinct biomes: ancient halls, narrow tunnels, and a buried forest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face guardian encounters unique to each biome — evade them, don't fight them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles and decipher ancient symbols</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure stealth survival — no weapons, no combat, only instinct</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey to a final, reality-breaking dimension where nothing obeys the rules you've learned</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two brothers. One vanished into the ruins first. Now you play the one left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Marzu</i> begins as your brother's story an explorer drawn into ancient ruins that were never meant to be found. When he disappears without a trace, you take his place, following the same corridors, the same warnings, and the same whispers that swallowed him whole. You have no weapons and no way to fight back. Your only chance is to stay hidden, stay quiet, and know when to run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/984873e5381e7b057504a59573a070e1.poster.avif?t=1786559928\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/984873e5381e7b057504a59573a070e1.webm?t=1786559928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/984873e5381e7b057504a59573a070e1.mp4?t=1786559928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Marzu</i> is a first-person survival horror game told through two perspectives. You begin as the first brother, exploring the ruins and encountering the first signs that something is wrong. When he becomes trapped, you take control of the second brother, whose journey is about uncovering the truth — not just surviving it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across your journey you'll move through vast ancient halls, cramped tunnels, and an overgrown forest buried within the ruins, each hiding its own dangers and its own guardian. There is no combat, no weapons, and no way to fight what hunts you. Survival depends entirely on stealth — staying out of sight, controlling your noise, and choosing the right moment to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/61c34b07efc76a1ec25b3202c011dde5.poster.avif?t=1786559928\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/61c34b07efc76a1ec25b3202c011dde5.webm?t=1786559928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/61c34b07efc76a1ec25b3202c011dde5.mp4?t=1786559928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/f509a6750742b2a87d62101ef52c12e6.poster.avif?t=1786559928\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/f509a6750742b2a87d62101ef52c12e6.webm?t=1786559928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/f509a6750742b2a87d62101ef52c12e6.mp4?t=1786559928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic lighting, detailed ancient architecture, and immersive 3D sound design bring each biome of <i>Marzu</i> to life   from the echoing stone of the great halls to the choking dark of the tunnels and the unnatural quiet of the forest. As you go deeper, even the world around you stop making sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/bd0c3bfefeb60144790f4ec50cf80813.poster.avif?t=1786559928\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/bd0c3bfefeb60144790f4ec50cf80813.webm?t=1786559928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/extras/bd0c3bfefeb60144790f4ec50cf80813.mp4?t=1786559928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play two brothers across one story — the one who was lost, and the one who follows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore distinct biomes: ancient halls, narrow tunnels, and a buried forest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face guardian encounters unique to each biome — evade them, don't fight them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles and decipher ancient symbols</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure stealth survival — no weapons, no combat, only instinct</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey to a final, reality-breaking dimension where nothing obeys the rules you've learned</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Something ancient lives in these ruins, and it already knows you're here. Flee through shifting halls, tunnels, and forests as unseen entities hunt your every move. Solve environmental puzzles, evade ancient horrors, and uncover a truth that unravels reality itself.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/f1d8630b837add1e1ab9ba01041b358568237dd1/header.jpg?t=1786559928", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/1b1abe533df5a19e5811cb7c55ea434b1c643a77/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786559928", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312090/1b1abe533df5a19e5811cb7c55ea434b1c643a77/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786559928", "website": "https://www.youtube.com/@HowToMakeGame", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100 / AMD Ryzen 3 3200G<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 / AMD RX 470<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul